regress/artifacts/wdcidselfcheck_20260925/pass551e/fable5_pass551e.md:10:- **H1 REFINE.** Reopens by the letter, measured (K1, J1). But the revision dropped the half of H1 that was right: the boundary statement (kimi-k3, glm — every in-file check reads state this file writes or output it prints). J3 closes the trailer; it does not close "the rows never ran and their observables were forged", which is a single insertion (below). Both the emission and the boundary go in.
