changelog551.md
7: **What ships.**
8: * `regress/diff_wdc_identify.c` (the offline IDENTIFY differential, 128 rows, built against the real `dev_wdc.c`):
9:   * `row_cmp()`, a pure comparator for `row()`'s capacity check -- `row()` used to test its want against its own input,
10:     so nothing could feed it a known mismatch;
11:   * `selfcheck()`, run FIRST and LAST: known answers and known MISmatches fed to `chk()` and `row_cmp()`, each required
12:     to change the tallies by exactly the right amount -- including each `row_cmp()` disjunct wrong alone with got ABOVE
13:     its want and `sectors` 0, so `<` for `!=` and an added `&& sectors` are red; the G text printed ONCE, by the last
14:     run, only when both passed; a self-check that did not pass counts one failure in the trailer; and the LAST one pins
